iling woman in a fashion boutique using a laptop and phone.\";s:10:\"author_url\";s:36:\"https://www.pexels.com/@silverkblack\";s:11:\"author_name\";s:13:\"Vitaly Gariev\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:9:\"landscape\";s:6:\"engine\";s:6:\"pexels\";s:10:\"engine_url\";s:18:\"https://pexels.com\";s:4:\"slug\";s:53:\"young-woman-shopping-online-in-fashion-store-36730470\";s:17:\"download_location\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:11:{s:2:\"id\";s:7:\"6347966\";s:3:\"url\";s:73:\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/6347966/pexels-photo-6347966.jpeg?w=1280\";s:13:\"optimized_url\";s:98:\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/6347966/pexels-photo-6347966.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=350\";s:11:\"description\";s:123:\"From above back view of crop anonymous female remote employee showing photography on netbook screen at table with hot drink\";s:10:\"author_url\";s:35:\"https://www.pexels.com/@liza-summer\";s:11:\"author_name\";s:11:\"Liza Summer\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:9:\"landscape\";s:6:\"engine\";s:6:\"pexels\";s:10:\"engine_url\";s:18:\"https://pexels.com\";s:4:\"slug\";s:71:\"crop-photographer-using-laptop-with-photo-on-screen-near-coffee-6347966\";s:17:\"download_location\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:11:{s:2:\"id\";s:8:\"16097558\";s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/16097558/pexels-photo-16097558.jpeg?w=1280\";s:13:\"optimized_url\";s:100:\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/16097558/pexels-photo-16097558.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=350\";s:11:\"description\";s:87:\"A young woman browses a clothing store during a sale, indicated by a red discount sign.\";s:10:\"author_url\";s:39:\"https://www.pexels.com/@vladimirsrajber\";s:11:\"author_name\";s:16:\"Vladimir Srajber\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:9:\"landscape\";s:6:\"engine\";s:6:\"pexels\";s:10:\"engine_url\";s:18:\"https://pexels.com\";s:4:\"slug\";s:45:\"young-woman-browsing-clothes-on-sale-16097558\";s:17:\"download_location\";s:0:\"\";}i:6;a:11:{s:2:\"id\";s:8:\"36730644\";s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/36730644/p